  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0f0\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#9b59b6\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/DreamForgeStudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0M8mHGS/Photoroom-20241208-183732-9.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/KVTP9SqQ3x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2MXprcq/Photoroom-20241208-183731-6.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fdreamforgestudio%252fdonate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gMntqZj/Photoroom-20241208-183732-8.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0f0\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#9b59b6\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0f0\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#9b59b6\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/DreamForgeStudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/c/DreamForgeStudio</a> 嘗試資源包與附加選項 KingdomCome 256x 512x 1280x</strong></span></span></span><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZctPJRj/Photoroom-20241208-183731-2.png\"><br>Dreamforge </span>是一個將藝術技藝與技術卓越完美結合的獨特工作室。沉浸在高品質紋理與模型的世界中，創作令人著迷且啟發靈感的視覺作品。每個細節都經過精心雕琢，展現我們對完美成果的熱情。<br><br>我們的團隊不斷測試並打磨每個模型，追求極致的寫實感與表現力。在持續的精煉循環中，我們尋找材質與光影的完美搭配，讓每張紋理煥發生機。這項艱辛卻令人興奮的工作需要耐心與勤勉，我們為過程中的每一步感到自豪。<br><br>在 <span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#9b59b6\">Dreamforge</span>，我們相信真正的美存在於細節之中。我們創作的不僅是模型與紋理，而是一個能帶領觀賞者展開精彩旅程的完整世界。</span><br>本專案免費提供，若您願意捐贈將不勝感激。<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#c9f\"><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fdreamforgestudio%252fdonate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/JKVwBgs/1733561533172.png\" width=\"256\" height=\"100\"></a><br>MetaMask</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#8e44ad\">0x5A3Fe4Bb9f2A83Bbd1b560Ac45EA0525012E92a7</span><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZctPJRj/Photoroom-20241208-183731-2.png\"><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:24px;color:#d35400\">嘗試資源包與附加選項 <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">=Alternate Reality=</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f29d12\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alternative-reality-ar-64x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">64x</a></span>,</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#27ae60\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alternative-reality-ar-128x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">128x</a></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#18a085\">,</span></span> <span style=\"color:#18a085\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#d35400\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alternative-reality-ar-128x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">256x</a></span></span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">測試版本：</span></span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px\">1.21.x <span style=\"color:#d35400\">原版</span> ， </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f29d12\">Forge + OptiFine</span>， </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px;color:#27ae60\">Fabric + Iris</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px\">新增 GUI（Alpha 版本）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px;color:#3598db\">不需要 OptiFine<br>為正確顯示植被，請在圖形設定中選擇：<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">精美</span></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/grZRtQV/huge-2022-12-17-17-21-49.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2022/521/16260403-huge_l.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2022/521/16210514_l.webp\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2022/521/16210483_l.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2022/521/16210487_l.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2022/521/16260404-huge_l.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">-----------------未來計畫--------------------</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">優化紋理與模型</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">新增紋理與模型</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">更多樣化內容</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">生物紋理</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">介面</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">以及其他紋理</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">--------------------------------------------</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#0ff\">推薦的陰影包：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#0ff\">===============================</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#0ff\">BSL<br>AstraLex Shaders (BSL Edit)<br>Insanity-Shader<br>Solas-Shader<br>Sildurs+Vibrant+Shaders</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#0ff\">===============================<br><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/DreamForgeStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#e67e23\">====================================================================================</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f00\"><a 